{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>הבוק.</b> From the root בוקק, and it is a verb-form from the doubled verbs. <b>תבוק.</b> Like תסוב (Psalms 114:3), and likewise הבוז תבוז. And after HaShem has decreed this, no glory will remain to a person over his fellows."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:51.136204950Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}